\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {10}{\ignorespaces The pre-recording screen. The two screens at the bottom will show the camera preview feeds for the left and right cameras (see figure \ref  {figure: participant} for an example). The control menu has a number of options. ``Triangulate'' will track the positions of the marker and show the estimated distance of the participant from the center of the PSAT cameras. ``Send Video'' cannot be unchecked. When ``Process data'' is selected the data will be processed immediately after the recording.}}{15}{figure.0.10}}
\newlabel{figure: pre-recording_screen}{{10}{15}{The pre-recording screen. The two screens at the bottom will show the camera preview feeds for the left and right cameras (see figure \ref {figure: participant} for an example). The control menu has a number of options. ``Triangulate'' will track the positions of the marker and show the estimated distance of the participant from the center of the PSAT cameras. ``Send Video'' cannot be unchecked. When ``Process data'' is selected the data will be processed immediately after the recording}{figure.0.10}{}}
